{
  "key": 20283,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "They built the new Radio Tower to\n",
        "replace the old, creaky one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you visited the Pokéathlon Dome?\n",
        "It is a huge sports facility where\f",
        "Pokémon compete with each other.\r",
        "It was quite a sight!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I know there’s a new Bike Shop,\n",
        "but I can’t find it anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "The fact that you have a Bike...\n",
        "means you got it from a Bike Shop,\f",
        "right?\r",
        "All right!\n",
        "I can say that there is a Bike Shop\f",
        "somewhere in this city!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Is that man in black dressed up\n",
        "like a Team Rocket member?\f",
        "How silly!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Was that man in black really part\n",
        "of Team Rocket?\f",
        "I can’t believe it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "The Radio Tower in Goldenrod City is\n",
        "a landmark.\r",
        "They’re running a promotional campaign\n",
        "right now.\r",
        "They’ll modify your Pokégear so it can\n",
        "also serve as a radio."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "The Radio Tower in Goldenrod City is\n",
        "a landmark.\r",
        "They’re running a promotional campaign\n",
        "right now.\r",
        "They’ll modify your Pokégear so it can\n",
        "also serve as a radio.\r",
        "Oh, your Pokégear works as a radio!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "E-he-he-he...\n",
        "I got in trouble for playing in the\f",
        "basement of the department store."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "The man at that tent rates your\n",
        "Pokémon names.\r",
        "He can even rename your Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "I think I’ll give my Pokémon cool\n",
        "nicknames as a reward if they do\f",
        "well in the Pokéathlon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Whew! This is one big town.\n",
        "I don’t know where anything is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "I know that you can find the\n",
        "Pokéathlon Dome when you take\f",
        "Route 35 north and go past the\f",
        "left gate...\r",
        "But I seem to get lost every time\n",
        "I come to this town..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00013",
      "en_US": "So this is the Radio Tower...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "What do you want, you pest?\n",
        "Scram!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "What are you doing?\n",
        "Get to your position right away!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon? They’re nothing more than\n",
        "tools for making money!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "We are on guard here.\n",
        "Don’t you worry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Take over the Radio Tower...\r",
        "What? It’s none of your business!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "You look awfully young...\n",
        "Are you new?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, brat! You don’t belong here!\f",
        "Get lost!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, hey!\n",
        "I’ve got this covered!\r",
        "Why don’t you go to the Radio Tower?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Friendship with Pokémon?\r",
        "That makes me laugh!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Our dream will soon come true...\n",
        "It was such a long struggle..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Who are you? A newcomer?\r",
        "We’ve run out of Team Rocket\n",
        "uniforms.\r",
        "One of my guys is going to get more...\r",
        "What’s taking him so long?\r",
        "The studio in the tunnel is just around\n",
        "the corner."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "For a young one like you to decide\n",
        "to become a member of Team Rocket...\f",
        "That’s great, kiddo!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Get out of my way!\r",
        "We, as Gym Trainers, will never allow\n",
        "Team Rocket to do nasty things here\f",
        "in our city!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Tee hee!\r",
        "You Gym Trainers can be a problem.\n",
        "Stay in the Gym and stay out of\f",
        "the way!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gym Leader, Whitney, went flying by\n",
        "saying, “I have got to\f",
        "get a Radio Card!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Wh-what are you trying to do?\n",
        "Can’t you see this cool, pitch-black\f",
        "uniform I’m wearing?\r",
        "You’re not afraid of Team Rocket? Huh?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t appear scary enough to be a\n",
        "Team Rocket member in that uniform...\f",
        "Make a scarier face and say, “Yeee!”\r",
        "All the while, clenching your teeth!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Where do you think you’re going?\n",
        "We are right in the middle of\f",
        "the mission!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Where do you think you are going?\n",
        "The Radio Tower is not here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "The GTS lets you trade Pokémon\n",
        "all over the world!\r",
        "...Except that we have something\n",
        "more important to do right now!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "If you love to trade so much, wait until\n",
        "the Radio Tower mission is over.\r",
        "Then you’ll have plenty of time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Slow down!\r",
        "I’m the only one who was sent here.\f",
        "Don’t give me any more trouble, OK?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0581_T25_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Johto-Kanto Magnet Train Line\n",
        "Goldenrod City Station"
      ]
    },
